{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>You shall not make for yourself a carved image or any likeness.</b> Elsewhere it gives the reason: כי לא ראיתם כל תמונה — lest you say, 'You are a hidden El and no one sees You; I shall make myself idols in Your memory, to bow to them for Your honor.'" "<b>Or any likeness.</b> An extra vav; meaning: you shall not make for yourself a carved image of any likeness, even if it has no face, since they are for idolatrous worship — such as the stones of Mercurius, which have no facial form. <b>Or any likeness</b> — any likeness at all, as in כל אלמנה ויתום."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:58:57.051862369Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}